PASS | fort-riley | FAQ JSON-LD == visible Q&A | page/src=[('Do Junction City and Manhattan get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Junction City (66441) and Manhattan (66502) are both in the FORT RILEY, KS housing area (KS100). BAH follows your duty-station ZIP anyway, not the town you rent in.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Riley cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,150–$1,650 and utilities of about $255–$520 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,314) lands between −$856 and −$91 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | ref=[('Do Junction City and Manhattan get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Junction City (66441) and Manhattan (66502) are both in the FORT RILEY, KS housing area (KS100). BAH follows your duty-station ZIP anyway, not the town you rent in.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Riley cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,150–$1,650 and utilities of about $255–$520 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,314) lands between −$856 and −$91 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
