PASS | fort-knox | FAQ JSON-LD == visible Q&A | page/src=[('Do Radcliff and Elizabethtown get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Radcliff (40160) and Elizabethtown (42701) are both in the FORT KNOX, KY housing area (KY110). BAH follows your duty-station ZIP anyway, not the town you rent in.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Knox cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,250–$1,750 and utilities of about $260–$520 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,647) lands between −$623 and $137 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | ref=[('Do Radcliff and Elizabethtown get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Radcliff (40160) and Elizabethtown (42701) are both in the FORT KNOX, KY housing area (KY110). BAH follows your duty-station ZIP anyway, not the town you rent in.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Knox cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,250–$1,750 and utilities of about $260–$520 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,647) lands between −$623 and $137 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
