PASS | fort-irwin | FAQ JSON-LD == visible Q&A | page/src=[('Why does DTMO call it Barstow/Fort Irwin?', 'DTMO places Fort Irwin and the National Training Center in the BARSTOW/FORT IRWIN, CA housing area (CA028), so Barstow (92311) rentals use the same rates.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Irwin cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,100–$1,600 and utilities of about $270–$540 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,001) lands between −$139 and $631 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | ref=[('Why does DTMO call it Barstow/Fort Irwin?', 'DTMO places Fort Irwin and the National Training Center in the BARSTOW/FORT IRWIN, CA housing area (CA028), so Barstow (92311) rentals use the same rates.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Irwin cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $1,100–$1,600 and utilities of about $270–$540 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,001) lands between −$139 and $631 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
